"Configure","target":"configure-onboarding-modals","line":190}],"metadata":{"title":"Next Experience banner announcements","description":"Banner announcements enable you to communicate planned maintenance, unplanned outages, or important events like ESPP stock plans or benefits enrollment to those affected or to everyone. You can target specific experiences or all experiences.Configure banner announcements to communicate important information to your users while they are in an experience.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/platform-user-interface/next-experience-banner-announcements.html","release":"australia","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":2,"breadcrumb":["Configure","Next Experience UI","Configure UIs and portals","Configure user experiences"],"tags":["#platform-user-interface","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/platform-user-interface/next-experience-banner-announcements.md"},
